# Marketing review notes

**Review date:** 2026-09-11  
**Source spec:** product/spec.md  
**Reviewed file:** marketing/launch-copy.md  

## Claims unsupported by the spec

### 1. "Works offline, anywhere"

Spec says: *"Offline support: removed in this release."*

The spec explicitly removes offline support. The copy claims it works offline, which is the opposite of the spec.

### 2. "Export to CSV, PDF and Excel"

Spec says: *"Export: CSV only."*

The copy promises export to three formats (CSV, PDF, Excel). The spec limits export to CSV alone. Both PDF and Excel are unsupported claims.
